# DF-200 tiltrotor SITL model — Excel-faithful test build
# Geometry/I/CG: docs/数据库_v2.xlsx (旋翼位置垂起行, 基本信息)
# Power: xlsx 动力参数 + docs/电机电池.docx (外60桨峰值~1379N, 内40@3600RPM=540N)
# Layout: inner 4 tilting + outer 4 fixed vertical. Same motor order as JT-20 / Lua.
#
# Structure frame (S): nose origin, X aft, Y right, Z up.
# APM body: hover CG origin, X fwd, Y right, Z down.
#   X_apm = CGx - X_s;  Y_apm = Y_s;  Z_apm = CGz - Z_s
# Hover CG (structure): (1.900, 0, 0.483) m
#
# QuadPlane does mass *= 1.5 after Frame::init → flight mass = json_mass * 1.5.
# This build uses Excel MTOW 380 kg → json mass = 380/1.5.
# Hover inertia diagonal from Excel 垂起矩阵: Ixx=783.6, Iyy=464.3, Izz=1052.3
# (2026-09-21: back to Excel values. History: cac1c2c Excel → 606be35
# isolation small-I [200.6,464.3,500.3] → f6867ac undocumented [700.6,464.3,1164.3]
# "works well"; see docs/df200_model_alignment_plan.md §1.2. Parm gains were
# restored from 086 against THIS Excel set, so json and parm are consistent again.)
#
# Thrust: peak Σ ≈ 4*1379 + 4*540 = 7676 N → T/W@380 ≈ 2.06
# hoverThrOut=0.30 → T_max_model = mass_json*g/0.30 ≈ 8.28 kN → T/W_flight≈2.22

